"text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supplies more than its out-edges carry. Costs may be negative, and negative cycles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saturated. A self-loop carries its capacity when its cost is negative and nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise. Capacities may be of an unsigned type, up to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int.max"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Computed by the network simplex with block-search pivots and strongly feasible trees.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Which optimum is returned when several exist is unspecified, but the same input always","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gives the same result. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supply"},{"text":" is called once per vertex in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order, then, for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each edge in position order, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"text":" and then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cost"},{"text":", before any work.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every capacity is at least zero; capacities, supplies and costs fit in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; Σ capacity × |cost| fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Cost","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (checked before solving, since it bounds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"total cost); 4(n + 1)(the greatest |cost| of a non-loop edge + 1) fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"solver’s artificial cost, with room for its potentials and reduced costs); the positive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supplies sum within ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/minimumcostflow(supply:capacity:cost:)"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/minimumCostFlow(supply:capacity:cost:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/Vertex":{"fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Vertex","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"Vertex","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/vertex"},"doc://Flows/documentation/Flows/MinimumCostFlow":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MinimumCostFlow","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/MinimumCostFlow","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MinimumCostFlow","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/flows\/minimumcostflow","title":"MinimumCostFlow","abstract":[{"text":"A minimum-cost flow, returned by ","type":"text"},{"code":"minimumCostFlow(supply:capacity:cost:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"minimumCostMaximumFlow(from:to:capacity:cost:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://Flows/d